<section class="container article-field-resource" id="simple-guide" aria-labelledby="four-cold-call-responses">
  <h2 id="four-cold-call-responses">Four replies for “How did you get my number?”</h2>
  <p>Pick the reply that fits. Replace the brackets with details you can verify.</p>
  <div class="contact-source-replies" id="sg-resource-text" tabindex="-1">
    <div id="public-business-number">
<h3>Public business listing</h3>
<blockquote>I found your work number on [specific listing]. I called because your team handles [business issue].</blockquote>
    </div>
    <div id="business-data-provider">
<h3>Business data provider</h3>
<blockquote>Your number came from [provider or approved source description]. I reached out because you oversee [relevant work].</blockquote>
    </div>
    <div id="personal-number">
<h3>Personal number</h3>
<blockquote>Thanks for flagging that. We had this listed as a work number. I’ll update the record so we stop calling this number.</blockquote>
    </div>
    <div id="concerned-prospect">
<h3>Concerned but open to hearing more</h3>
<blockquote>I got it from [source]. I called about [specific business issue]. Would you like the short version, or should I leave it there?</blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>
  <button class="btn-primary" type="button" id="sg-copy-resource" hidden>Copy all four replies</button>
  <span class="article-field-resource-status" id="sg-copy-status" role="status"></span>
</section>
